(7439321, 1176091, 181814, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by clickodak:</b></div><hr/><i> Difficult for me to make a link with the chalenge. However for your composition I give 7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I would say the composition creates the wide open space all over the rest of the photograph. The theme did not say wide open landscapes, like most people must have assumed.Thanks for the vote and the comment I really appreciate it, good luck to you.</td>', 'Originally posted by clickodak: Difficult for me to make a link with the chalenge. However for your composition I give 7   I would say the composition creates the wide open space all over the rest of the photograph. The theme did not say wide open landscapes, like most people must have assumed.Thanks for the vote and the comment I really appreciate it, good luck to you.', '2016-02-24 09:32:49.000000', NULL, 0),
